Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:28.90,H_en,,0,0,0,,The system gave him BATTERY TECH. "Tomorrow it'll give you BILLIONS."
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:28.90,C_en,,0,0,0,,Watch ALL episodes FREE ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:00.94,S_en,,0,0,0,,Creating things from nothing —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.88,S_en,,0,0,0,,This is the reward the system gave.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.92,0:00:02.82,S_en,,0,0,0,,What's inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.86,0:00:04.10,S_en,,0,0,0,,Complete tech for lithium-air batteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.14,0:00:05.94,S_en,,0,0,0,,That's what the system note said.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.98,0:00:06.88,S_en,,0,0,0,,Young man,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.92,0:00:08.02,S_en,,0,0,0,,you've now proven your system
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.06,0:00:08.96,S_en,,0,0,0,,is most likely real.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:10.14,S_en,,0,0,0,,Do you know what that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.18,0:00:11.08,S_en,,0,0,0,,I—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.12,0:00:12.02,S_en,,0,0,0,,It means
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.06,0:00:12.96,S_en,,0,0,0,,you'll get promoted!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:15.06,S_en,,0,0,0,,Be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.10,0:00:16.02,S_en,,0,0,0,,Go on, Uncle Chen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.06,0:00:17.10,S_en,,0,0,0,,The system's existence
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.14,0:00:18.04,S_en,,0,0,0,,means you possess
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.08,0:00:19.66,S_en,,0,0,0,,a destiny-changing artifact.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.70,0:00:21.34,S_en,,0,0,0,,Today it sends you technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.38,0:00:22.28,S_en,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.32,0:00:23.58,S_en,,0,0,0,,it could send tens of billions in cash,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.62,0:00:24.82,S_en,,0,0,0,,even superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.86,0:00:26.30,S_en,,0,0,0,,As long as you lie low,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.34,0:00:27.38,S_en,,0,0,0,,you can absolutely become
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.42,0:00:28.86,S_en,,0,0,0,,the protagonist of this world.
